34855412.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/loud-slogans-selective-action-bjp-chief-nabin-questions-rahuls-silence-on-allegations-against-congress-mp-after-jnu-dismissal/articleshow/134855412.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/loud-slogans-selective-action-bjp-chief-nabin-questions-rahuls-silence-on-allegations-against-congress-mp-after-jnu-dismissal/articleshow/134855412.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-10T19:03:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134855500,imgsize-144970.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Seek to turn Delhi into battleground': CM Rekha Gupta slams CJP, Rahul &amp; Kejriwal amid anti-SIR protests]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/seek-to-turn-delhi-into-battleground-cm-rekha-gupta-slams-cjp-rahul-kejriwal-amid-anti-sir-protests/articleshow/134855279.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134855279.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Delhi's Chief Minister Rekha Gupta has placed the spotlight on Rahul Gandhi and Arvind Kejriwal, blaming them for worsening political strife in the capital. Amid protests against Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar, thousands faced detainment while trying to reach Jantar Mantar. Gupta expressed concern over the opposition's actions impacting public life, stating they undermine the democratic mandate.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/seek-to-turn-delhi-into-battleground-cm-rekha-gupta-slams-cjp-rahul-kejriwal-amid-anti-sir-protests/articleshow/134855279.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/seek-to-turn-delhi-into-battleground-cm-rekha-gupta-slams-cjp-rahul-kejriwal-amid-anti-sir-protests/articleshow/134855279.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-10T19:01:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134855428,imgsize-90782.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[The period cycle: What happens in your body beyond the five days of bleeding]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/the-period-cycle-what-happens-in-your-body-beyond-the-five-days-of-bleeding/articleshow/134854896.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134854896.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[When we discuss menstrual health, it’s important to recognize that it’s more than just the time of the month. Hormonal changes are ongoing and can impact women's overall well-being, including energy, emotions, and comfort levels. Understanding these aspects leads to dismantling harmful taboos and encourages supportive behaviors in both personal and professional environments, promoting a healthier dialogue around menstruation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/the-period-cycle-what-happens-in-your-body-beyond-the-five-days-of-bleeding/articleshow/134854896.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/the-period-cycle-what-happens-in-your-body-beyond-the-five-days-of-bleeding/articleshow/134854896.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-10T18:50:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kanchan Yadav</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134856937,imgsize-89105.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Evening news wrap: Delhi in grips of anti-CEC stir; oppn leaders &amp; protesters detained, BJP targets Congress]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-delhi-in-grips-of-ant